00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:07.940
a screenplay when you were undergrad at
Columbia versus once you had already

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:11.430
been established at USC come to dodge
College

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:17.430
well the to sell a screenplay I guess
you mean when I was a grad student when

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:21.450
I was an undergrad I didn't know the
scripts our movies are written I didn't

