00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:35.250
it be in the trenches or teaching or
around career screenwriters well from

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:41.850
the get-go I was interested in I guess
you could say connecting with an

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:47.400
audience okay so that's the impulse and
I saw myself as a filmmaker and not a

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:53.400
screenwriter and Frank Daniel's notion
