00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:15.730
when you do your day job and you're
earning your they're paying your dues

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:22.910
don't get a job that's somewhat creative
because it could be it can satisfied

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:28.220
your creative impulse and then you you
won't be as passionate about your

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:34.400
writing so for example don't go into
