during the during the day as much as I
could

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:09.620
don't tell anybody at Showtime that I
tried to tell them I was working at hard

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:16.250
but you know so does that answer your
question about the market or the my

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:23.510
expectations for how to sell it just
write something that people don't want

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:26.630
to put down that grabs them they can't
put down

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:31.700
and then be patient and try working one
step at a time to get it out there and

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:37.789
to meet people that can maybe get get
something done with it and the first

00:08:37.789 --> 00:08:44.720
writing actual job that I got was
through a friend and this is in 1990 so

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.080
there was a period of a lot of
