00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:33.610
from being at Showtime what did you
learn about a-flat script versus a

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:41.560
viable script to me I'm looking for
something it's it's pretty basic it's

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:52.960
does it grab me and does it keep me
